        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="One site at docs.&amp;lt;domain&amp;gt;, built on Zudoku. Each owner has its own repo, pipeline and folder; a shared preset package keeps the look consistent. Draft v0.1 · 2026-10-28" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#4B5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
